message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper."
title: "Point-group filtering in unitary coupled-cluster ansätze: reproducibility repository"
abstract: >-
  Code, aggregated results, environment snapshots and figures for the canonical
  experiments behind the paper, on the variational cost of molecular point-group
  filtering in unitary coupled-cluster ansätze.
type: software
